<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex reports first nine mos crude prices.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex reports first nine mos crude prices.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its average prices for crude exports by region. Figures are in dollars per barrel.</p>
<p>    Item		First Nine Mos. 1995  First Nine Mos. 1996</p>
<p>    Export Basket	    15.74		     18.04</p>
<p>    Olmeca		     17.51		     20.47</p>
<p>    Isthmus		    16.76		     19.10</p>
<p>    Maya			 14.50		     16.47</p>
<p>Western Hemisphere</p>
<p>    Olmeca		     17.51		     20.47</p>
<p>    Isthmus		    16.53		     19.68</p>
<p>    Maya			 14.52		     16.59</p>
<p>Europe</p>
<p>    Isthmus		    16.20		     18.62</p>
<p>    Maya			 14.46		     15.76</p>
<p>Asia</p>
<p>    Isthmus		    17.08		     18.45</p>
<p>    Maya			 14.30		     15.51</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903</p>
</text>
